<https://vocabularies.verizon.com/core-mappings> a owl:Ontology;
  rdfs:label "Vocabulary | Core | Cross-scheme Mappings"@en;
  dct:description "SKOS mapping links that tie the 20 core vocabularies into one lineage: where core-businessoperations and core-technicalservices attach under core-services, and which same-named concepts in different schemes mean the same thing. Same-label pairs whose senses differ (Customer, Design, Guideline, Implementation, Investigation, Commercial, Finance, Strategy, Customer Support, Sales Operations, Data Architecture, Data Security) are deliberately left unmapped."@en;
  owl:versionInfo "1.1";
  dct:modified "2026-10-05"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .

